{
  "title": "FSx · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "특정 파일 시스템을 관리형으로 제공하는 서비스 계열이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>FSx</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">FSx for Windows File Server</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#windows-single-az-and-multi-az\">Windows Single-AZ and Multi-AZ</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">FSx for Lustre</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#scratch-and-persistent\">Scratch and Persistent</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#data-repository-associations\">Data Repository Associations</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">FSx for NetApp ONTAP</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#ontap-tiering-and-replication\">ONTAP Tiering and Replication</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-openzfs\">FSx for OpenZFS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#backup-and-network-access\">Backup and Network Access</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>26 / 62</span></div><h1>FSx</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 9 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon FSx는 서로 다른 File System을 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>에서 관리형으로 제공하는 서비스군이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">Windows File Server</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">NetApp ONTAP</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-openzfs\">OpenZFS</a>는 Protocol·OS 기능·성능·복제 방식이 다르다.</p><p>먼저 기존 앱의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a> 요구와 Identity·Lock·Snapshot 기능을 확인한다. 그 다음 Single-<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> 지원, Storage Tier·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>, Backup과 비용을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Protocol과 Workload로 선택\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Protocol과 Workload로 선택</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Windows / Multiprotocol</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> + AD</strong><small>Windows File 공유</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">FSx for Windows File Server</a></strong><small>Native Windows 기능</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">ONTAP</a> alternative</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a> 복합 요구</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Linux / Parallel processing</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> or HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span></strong><small>앱의 File Protocol</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-openzfs\">OpenZFS</a> or <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a></strong><small>ZFS 기능 또는 병렬 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Storage / Deployment</strong><small>유형별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·Tier·Backup 검토</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">FSx 제품군 전체가 같은 Protocol·Failover·Storage 기능을 제공하지 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">File system</th><th scope=\"col\">Protocol</th><th scope=\"col\">Typical requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">Windows File Server</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a></td><td>AD / Windows ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a> client</td><td>HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> integration</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">NetApp ONTAP</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">ONTAP</a> / Multiprotocol</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-openzfs\">OpenZFS</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a></td><td>ZFS / Linux-Unix</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fsx-for-windows-file-server\"><h2>FSx for Windows File Server<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Native <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">Windows File Server</a> 기반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> 공유다. Active Directory, Windows ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>, DFS 및 지원 Windows 기능과 통합한다. Linux <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a>가 핵심인 앱과는 Protocol 요구가 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"windows-single-az-and-multi-az\"><h2>Windows Single-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> and Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#windows-single-az-and-multi-az\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Single-<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 구성이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>는 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Standby와 Failover를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>와 Backup은 장애 대응·시점 복원의 역할이 다르다. Storage·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a> 용량과 Client의 Failover 재연결도 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fsx-for-lustre\"><h2>FSx for Lustre<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span>·Machine Learning·대규모 병렬 처리용 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a> File System이다. 여러 Compute의 높은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>을 제공하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Data Repository와 연결할 수 있다. Windows <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> 파일 서버 요구를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a>로 충족시키는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"scratch-and-persistent\"><h2>Scratch and Persistent<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#scratch-and-persistent\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a> Scratch는 임시 처리 데이터에 맞고 장애 후 재생성할 수 있다는 전제가 필요하다. Persistent는 장기 저장·복제를 위한 모델이다. 현재 SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-intelligent-tiering\">Intelligent-Tiering</a>·HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span> 등 지원 Storage 선택과 배포 유형의 조합을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"data-repository-associations\"><h2>Data Repository Associations<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#data-repository-associations\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 사이 Import·Export를 연결한다. 필요한 File Metadata를 가져오고 처리 결과를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에 반영하는 Workflow를 설계할 수 있다. 연계된 File System의 모든 변경이 무조건 즉시 양방향 동기화된다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fsx-for-netapp-ontap\"><h2>FSx for NetApp ONTAP<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">ONTAP</a> 기능을 관리형으로 제공하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a>를 지원한다. Storage Virtual Machine과 Volume으로 Protocol·Identity·접근을 관리한다. 기존 NetApp 환경 이동·Multiprotocol·Block 접근 요구에 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ontap-tiering-and-replication\"><h2>ONTAP Tiering and Replication<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#ontap-tiering-and-replication\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>와 Capacity Pool Tiering, Snapshot·Clone·SnapMirror 등의 기능을 제공한다. 자주 읽는 데이터와 Cold 데이터를 구분해 비용·성능을 조정한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> 가용성과 Volume 복제·Backup의 보호 범위를 각각 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fsx-for-openzfs\"><h2>FSx for OpenZFS<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-openzfs\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-4\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 4\">[4]</a></h2><p>ZFS 기반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> File System으로 Snapshot·Clone·Compression 등 기능을 제공한다. 기존 Linux·Unix의 ZFS·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> Workload에 비교한다. Windows AD·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> 요구는 다른 FSx 유형과 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backup-and-network-access\"><h2>Backup and Network Access<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#backup-and-network-access\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>유형별 자동·수동 Backup, Restore와 Network Endpoint 조건을 확인한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>, Routing, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>와 Identity 연결이 필요하다. File System 종류가 달라도 Backup을 동일한 포맷으로 임의 교환할 수 있는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Windows AD와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>가 필수이면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">Windows File Server</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Data Lake를 HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span>에서 병렬 처리하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-lustre\">Lustre</a>, 기존 NetApp 복제·Multiprotocol이면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">ONTAP</a>을 비교한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>모든 FSx 파일 시스템이 같은 프로토콜과 기능을 제공하지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/WindowsGuide/what-is.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fsx/latest/WindowsGuide/what-is.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/LustreGuide/what-is.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fsx/latest/LustreGuide/what-is.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/what-is-fsx-ontap.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/what-is-fsx-ontap.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/OpenZFSGuide/what-is-fsx.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fsx/latest/OpenZFSGuide/what-is-fsx.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q048/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q048\" data-question=\"Q048\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q048</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q048/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which managed file system supports SMB shares and Windows ACLs for Windows servers?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">FSx for Windows File Server</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>와 Windows 파일 기능에 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q049\" data-question=\"Q049\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q049</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises application expects an SMB file share, while new files must be stored as objects in S3. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체 저장을 연결한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q086\" data-question=\"Q086\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q086</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q086/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Amazon EFS over NFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot as a file share</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Route 53 Resolver</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · 관리형 Windows 파일 시스템에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체로 이어지는 하이브리드 파일 인터페이스에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q050\" data-question=\"Q050\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q050</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company repeatedly transfers data from an on-premises NAS to EFS and S3 over the network and synchronizes changes. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snow Family only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 온라인 데이터 전송·동기화를 자동화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q040\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">이전 용어 <b>EventBridge</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">다음 용어 <b>Global Accelerator</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
